  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Open Data for Agriculture and Nutrition (GODAN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To coordinate international activities in agricultural/nutritional open data that will help to ensure governments and businesses are more transparent and accountable to citizens and that entrepreneurs are able to innovate with data to find better ways of doing things or to create new products, services and data-driven businesses in the agricultural/nutritional sectors. The project will sart in Nov 2014 and end in Nov 2019.</narrative>
  </description>
